From 17af8b480b376dc2ff9f0672b07374d0f94fe1af Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Johan=20Sellstr=C3=B6m?= <johan.sellstrom@iproov.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 07:20:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [Prototype] Web NFC: NFCIsoDepReader for eMRTD identity
 documents

Adds NFCIsoDepReader / NFCIsoDepTag behind the WebNFCIsoDep runtime flag.
The browser classifies tapped ISO-DEP tags as ICAO Doc 9303 eMRTDs before
exposing them, and filters plaintext command APDUs so only the eMRTD
application can be selected. Android only; iOS rejects scan() with
NotSupportedError.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
